<p>Hello {{ user.displayName ?? user.email }},</p>

<p>Someone just tried to create a new Keres account using your email address. No new account was created, because you already have one.</p>

<p>If this was you and you'd simply forgotten you already had an account, you can log in directly, or reset your password if you don't remember it:</p>

<p>
    <a href="{{ lostPasswordUrl }}">Reset your password</a>
</p>

<p>If you did not try to register, you can safely ignore this email — no action is needed and your account is unchanged.</p>
